@startuml neural-overview
' Map of the `neural` module (feature: neural-rescore). One ModernBertModel is loaded
' once and shared by Arc across three consumers: embedder, rescorer, summarizer.
' Green = neural; blue = statistical LM core; purple = retrieval; orange = code/LaTeX;
' grey = external crates. The KV-cache family is drawn detached and muted because it is
' scaffolding: nothing in ModernBertModel::forward reads or writes it.
' Render: plantuml -tsvg docs/diagrams/neural-overview.puml
' Source of truth for Figure 1 in docs/components/neural/overview.md §2.
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam rectangle {
  FontColor white
  FontStyle bold
  BorderColor #263238
  roundCorner 12
}
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam ArrowFontColor #37474F
title The neural module — one encoder, three consumers  (feature: neural-rescore)

legend top right
  |= Color |= Role |
  |<#2E7D32>     | Neural (this module) |
  |<#1565C0>     | Statistical LM core |
  |<#6A1B9A>     | Retrieval / RAG |
  |<#EF6C00>     | Code / LaTeX |
  |<#546E7A>     | External crates |
  |<#90A4AE>     | Scaffolding — not wired |
endlegend

rectangle "**Hugging Face Hub**\nhf-hub · model.safetensors\nconfig.json · tokenizer.json" as hub #546E7A
rectangle "**Candle**\ncandle-core · candle-nn\ncandle-transformers::modernbert" as candle #546E7A

rectangle "**ModernBertModel**\nencoder + MLM head + tokenizer\nhidden_size · vocab_size · device" as model #2E7D32

rectangle "**ModernBertEmbedder**\nembed · embed_batch\nembed_document · embed_query" as embedder #2E7D32
rectangle "**ModernBertRescorer**\nscore_sentence · score_batch\nrescore_paths" as rescorer #2E7D32
rectangle "**Summarizer**\nextractive · create_synopsis\n(MMR selection)" as summarizer #2E7D32
rectangle "**EmbeddingCache**\nDashMap<u64, Arc<[f32]>>\n+ LRU VecDeque" as ecache #2E7D32

rectangle "**n-gram / hybrid beam**\nScoredPath { tokens, ngram_score }" as beam #1565C0
rectangle "**RAG**\nIndexBuilder · RagIndex\nRetriever  (feature: rag)" as rag #6A1B9A
rectangle "**LaTeX rescorer**\n(feature: latex-neural)" as latex #EF6C00
rectangle "**Code embeddings**\n(feature: code-neural)" as codeemb #EF6C00

rectangle "**KvCache · LayerCache**\n**SlidingWindowCache**\nautoregressive KV reuse\n— unused by this encoder —" as kv #90A4AE

hub --> model : download &\nmmap weights
candle --> model : tensors, layers,\nlog_softmax

model --> embedder : Arc<ModernBertModel>
model --> rescorer : Arc<ModernBertModel>
embedder --> summarizer : owns
embedder --> ecache : memoize\ntext ↦ vector

beam --> rescorer : top-k paths
rescorer --> beam : re-ranked paths

embedder --> rag : document &\nquery vectors
summarizer --> rag : synopsis
model --> latex : score_sentence
model --> codeemb : encoder reuse

note bottom of kv #ECEFF1
  ModernBERT is a **bidirectional encoder**: every position
  attends to every other position, so nothing is reusable
  across steps. KV caching pays off only for autoregressive
  decoding. These types compile, are exported and unit-tested,
  but no call site in the crate constructs them.
end note

note right of ecache #E8F5E9
  The only cache on a live path.
  Keyed by a 64-bit digest of the text
  (gxhash ≥ 16 B, else xxh3).
end note

@enduml
